title: LunchGuy
---
<<declare $helpingLunchGuy = false>>
<<declare $gingerDefeated = false>>
<<declare $gotGregsFood = false>>
<<declare $boughtMeal = false>>
<<declare $seenWindowsGuy = false>>

<<if $gotGregsFood>>
    Greg: Enjoy the food, man. You earned it!
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if $gingerDefeated>>
    Greg: DUDE! YOU ACTUALLY DID IT?!
    Greg: I honestly didn't think you'd go through with that!
    Greg: Well, a deal's a deal. Here's my Cowfila!
    <<jump GregGivesFood>>
<<endif>>

// If the player already accepted the quest
<<if $helpingLunchGuy>>
    Greg: Well? Did you punch that ginger?
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if getBool("guyhasLunch")>>
    Greg: Oh hey, didn't see you standing there eye balling my food... Whats up??
<<else>>
    Greg: Hey man no shoving, wait in line.
    -> Wait till he gets his food. <<if hasActions()>>
        <<useAction>>
        <<stop>>
    -> Back.
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>

-> Whatcha doing with that food??? <<if getBool("guyhasLunch")>>
    <<jump GuyEating>>
-> Nothin
    <<stop>>
===

title: GuyEating
---
Greg: Gee, I wonder what I could possibly be doing with this food right now.
Greg: What do you want?
-> Can I have it?
    <<jump TakingFood>>
    <<stop>>
-> Never mind
    <<stop>>
===

title: TakingFood
---
<<set $helpingLunchGuy = true>>
Greg: Hmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm.
Greg: If you need the food I could give it to ya, but you gotta do something for me.
Greg: See that ginger over ther? I need you to punch him. He's had it coming...
Greg: Do that and you can do whatever you want with it, I'll wait before eating it.
<<stop>>
===

title: GregGivesFood
---
<<set $gotGregsFood = true>>
Greg: Here you go, one fresh Cowfila meal!
Greg: Don't say I never did anything for ya!
<<stop>>
===


title: Ginger
---
<<if !$gingerDefeated>>
    Ginger: Oh hey! What's up?  
    -> Not much, any fun facts about yourself? 
       Ginger: Oh, well not much off the top of my head. I did just buy a new Windows computer, it's great! I sure do love my WINDOWS operating system!  
       <<set $seenWindowsGuy = true>>
       <<stop>>
   -> Punch him. <<if $helpingLunchGuy and hasActions() and not $gingerDefeated>>
       <<jump PunchGinger>>
   -> See ya.
       <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<stop>>
===

title: PunchGinger
---
<<useAction>>
Ginger: OW! OH YOU'RE DEAD!

<<if $lukeWillHelp>>
    <<jump PunchWithLuke>>
<<else>>
    <<jump PunchWithoutLuke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: PunchWithLuke
---
Luke: IS THAT THE WINDOW'S LOVER?!
<<PunchWithLuke>>
<<set $gingerDefeated = true>>
<<stop>>
===

title: PunchWithoutLuke
---
<<PunchWithoutLuke>>
<<stop>>
===



title: Worker
---
<<if $boughtMeal>>
    Worker: Welcome back to Cowfila!
    Worker: Sorry, we're limiting everyone to one meal today!
    -> Alright, thanks!
        Worker: Have a great day!
        <<stop>>
<<else>>
    Worker: Welcome to Cowfila! What can I get for you?
    -> Can I get a meal? <<if hasActions()>>
        <<jump BuyMeal>>
    -> Just looking, thanks!
        Worker: No problem! Let me know if you need anything!
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: BuyMeal
---
<<useAction>>
<<set $boughtMeal = true>>
Worker: Coming right up!
Worker: Here's your Cowfila meal! Enjoy!
<<stop>>
===
